		in a world that seems to be comming against islam and Palestinians and arabs in general, it feels so nice to see this site and all the supporters. so many anti-islamic things in the media and on internet now days, let's show good, Bismillah! My heart goes out to my family in Palestine, and all those,arab, christian, jew, whatever, who support us. God have mercy on the millions of people i hear blaspheme Islam.
		<div align="right">
		<i>18 September 2002</i>
		
