    <tr valign="top"> <td bgcolor="#fffff0" width="600">
			<font face="Arial" size="2" color="#000000">
			
		I send my love to the Palestinian People. <br>You have so much to be proud of.<br>Your daily struggles make my small problems seem so unimportant. I admire you very much. Keep fighting, and working for your freedom. Gradually more people are waking up to what the Israelis are doing to you and your land. Unfortunately while the USA supports Israel because of its own interests in the Middle East I fear that there is little room for progress. But history has a way of surprising us, and I will pray for change.
		<div align="right">
		<i>18 September 2002</i>
		
			<i> - United Kingdom</i>
			
		</div>
		
		</font></td></tr>
		
