		I came from CHINA where many chinese student are living a peaceful Environment,but your children are living dark palace where many people are toutured and killed by the israeli.I cannot image your that hamas movement belief is so strong and confidence because you are facing so many pressure and difficulties including the strong israeli and authority'pressure.I understand your act deeply which is only way for struggle,and think it is not terrisom,It is just justice,It is hero act devote himself for people'free , the dependence of palestine and the people'dignity.I pround of you and think your movement is the bravest movement in the world,I believe that palestine peolple only own the movement they will not failure for ever and your goal will be achieved in the end.<br> Here, I express my condolence deeply for those people who devote his life for the palestine'free ,espicallly for the pass away of SALAH SHIHADA <br> <br>,I believe martyr's blood is in your heart forever.<br> In a word,I support you!<br>
