   <tr valign="top"> <td bgcolor="#ffffd0" width="600">
			<font face="Arial" size="2" color="#000000">
			
		I would like to offer my heartfelt condolences to the people of Palestine and their great losses. I am a Christian-American. I am saddened and heartsick over the United States support of the Israelian occupation of Palestinian land. I have sent several messages to President Bush stating my position and requesting that the U.S. stop the funding of millions of dollars to the Israelian government. I am in support of helping the People of Palestine to overcome the hardships imposed on them by Israel and the U.S. Government's. As an American I am saddened by the fact that our Great country likes to say that it will extend a helping hand out to any country and yet we overlook Palestine and it's people. My firm belief is that the biggest terrorist of all is none other then: ARIEL SHARON! May peace and love find it's way to the People of Palestine.
		<div align="right">
		<i>11 September 2002</i>
		
			<i> - USA</i>
			
		</div>
		
		</font></td></tr>
		
