   <tr valign="top"> <td bgcolor="#ffffd0" width="600">
			<font face="Arial" size="2" color="#000000">
			
		I sympathise with all arabs and muslims living in Isreal, although I am english and a Christian, I believe that Palestine should have their land back. The land does not belong to the Jews, after all they are a religion not a race, so because of the UN the Jews have taken someone elses land. This is not right. I do not condone the suicide bombers of Palestine either, I don't believe in killing one another, but both sides have to talk but I guess with the US backing the Jews this won't be the way? The only way maybe is to share the land equally? All the best for peace in your land, we in the UK are thinking of you
