    <tr valign="top"> <td bgcolor="#fffff0" width="600">
			<font face="Arial" size="2" color="#000000">
			
		Here in the UK, we are extremely open minded and most people are disgusted with the happenings in Palestine. Our hearts go out to the brave Palestinians as evil people like Ariel Sharon continue to spin a web of lies around every event that takes place. I just hope the Palestinians never lose hope and that they remember, there are people in the world of their side.
